From: ossia SDK maintainers
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qmlmodels: adapt to QAbstractItemModel compareData overloads

qtbase 99c5eee57f8 replaced the nullable QCollator pointer overload with
separate overloads taking no collator or a QCollator reference. Keep
QQmlSortFilterProxyModel's nullable internal API and dispatch accordingly.
---
diff --git a/src/qmlmodels/sfpm/qqmlsortfilterproxymodel.cpp b/src/qmlmodels/sfpm/qqmlsortfilterproxymodel.cpp
--- a/src/qmlmodels/sfpm/qqmlsortfilterproxymodel.cpp
+++ b/src/qmlmodels/sfpm/qqmlsortfilterproxymodel.cpp
@@ -832,6 +832,7 @@ Qt::weak_ordering QQmlSortFilterProxyModel::compareData(const QVariant &lhs, con
                                                         const QCollator *collator)
 {
-    return QAbstractItemModel::compareData(lhs, rhs, collator);
+    return collator ? QAbstractItemModel::compareData(lhs, rhs, *collator)
+                    : QAbstractItemModel::compareData(lhs, rhs);
 }
 
 /*!
